+Empirical-score alignment provides a threshold-free second readout. Let $s^\star$ be the population score, $s_{\rm emp}$ the exact score of the empirical distribution of the $n$ training points, and $s_\theta$ the learned score, all in the signal coordinates at $t=0.1$. The alignment coefficient
